1
00:00:00,700 --> 00:00:02,350
Habari, mimi ni Naman kutoka Mixar.

2
00:00:02,750 --> 00:00:06,200
Kwa dakika chache nitakuonyesha programu hii.

3
00:00:06,760 --> 00:00:08,250
Hili ni eneo lako la mwonekano.

4
00:00:08,250 --> 00:00:10,300
Nafasi ya 3D unayoweza kuzunguka ndani yake.

5
00:00:11,000 --> 00:00:13,200
Buruta kwa kitufe cha kati kuzungusha, sogeza gurudumu kukuza.

6
00:00:13,200 --> 00:00:15,400
Shift na kitufe cha kati husogeza mwonekano.

7
00:00:15,850 --> 00:00:17,160
Jaribu mwenyewe.

8
00:00:18,180 --> 00:00:20,700
Bofya kuchagua, G kusogeza,

9
00:00:20,700 --> 00:00:22,600
R kuzungusha, S kubadili ukubwa.

10
00:00:22,600 --> 00:00:25,410
Hizi ni baadhi ya njia za mkato muhimu.

11
00:00:26,040 --> 00:00:29,500
Unaona kisiwa kidogo chini? Huyo ni Mixie, wakala wako.

12
00:00:30,000 --> 00:00:31,180
Bofya kukifungua.

13
00:00:32,210 --> 00:00:33,700
Mixie ina vichupo.

14
00:00:33,920 --> 00:00:38,800
Katika Agent, sema unachotaka kwa maneno rahisi. Wakala atafanyia kazi mandhari yako.

15
00:00:39,400 --> 00:00:43,300
Wakala hutumia modeli kama Tripo, Meshy na Nano Banana.

16
00:00:43,300 --> 00:00:46,180
Kwa udhibiti zaidi, fungua vichupo vingine:

17
00:00:46,180 --> 00:00:49,730
3D, Image, Video au World Model.

18
00:00:49,730 --> 00:00:53,090
Chagua modeli na urekebishe mipangilio yake.

19
00:00:53,560 --> 00:00:55,730
Kila unachozalisha huingia kwenye maktaba.

20
00:00:56,670 --> 00:00:58,700
Ubunifu wako uko hapa.

21
00:00:59,140 --> 00:01:03,000
Unganisha maktaba yako ili wakala atumie rasilimali zako,

22
00:01:03,000 --> 00:01:06,320
na uokoe mikopo.

23
00:01:06,830 --> 00:01:09,550
Juu kushoto kuna droo ya mandhari.

24
00:01:09,550 --> 00:01:12,980
Kila mandhari ina kichupo chake na wakala Mixie.

25
00:01:12,980 --> 00:01:17,010
Endesha kazi sambamba na ubadilishe kati yake wakati wowote.

26
00:01:17,640 --> 00:01:21,100
Mandhari ikikamilika, badili kwenda Cinema Mode

27
00:01:21,100 --> 00:01:24,510
kuongoza kamera na kuunda mtiririko wa kazi za video.

28
00:01:25,000 --> 00:01:26,700
Mawazo huanza katika 2D.

29
00:01:26,700 --> 00:01:29,860
Vuta moodboard kutoka kulia au bonyeza tilde.

30
00:01:30,860 --> 00:01:33,500
Ni turubai ya marejeleo na dhana.

31
00:01:33,500 --> 00:01:36,270
Weka picha, video au michoro hapa.

32
00:01:36,940 --> 00:01:40,930
Jenga grafu za nodi za modeli zalishi kama katika ComfyUI.

33
00:01:41,680 --> 00:01:44,400
Uko katika Zen Mode, mwonekano rahisi zaidi.

34
00:01:44,400 --> 00:01:46,840
Unaijua Blender? Badili kwenda Engine Mode.

35
00:01:47,770 --> 00:01:51,900
Eneo lote la kazi la Blender lipo, pamoja na kila paneli na njia ya mkato.

36
00:01:52,980 --> 00:01:56,400
Mixie hufanya kazi katika zote mbili. Chagua inayokufaa.

37
00:01:56,560 --> 00:01:57,570
Turudi katika Zen Mode.

38
00:01:58,230 --> 00:02:02,200
Programu yetu ya washirika wabunifu inakupa mikopo

39
00:02:02,200 --> 00:02:05,900
na jumuiya inayounda mustakabali wa AI na 3D.

40
00:02:06,580 --> 00:02:08,550
Ni hayo tu. Sasa unajua kila kitu kilipo.

41
00:02:08,550 --> 00:02:10,240
Tuunde 3D pamoja.
